<td id="S3.T4.2.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:20.0pt;padding-right:20.0pt;">  <span id="S3.T4.2.1.2.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Value</span></td></tr>
