<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Machine Reading Comprehension</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px3.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate the models’ performance on the TibetanQA dataset to assess their machine reading comprehension capabilities in Tibetan. The models are fine-tuned on Chinese (CMRC) or English (SQuAD) datasets and tested on TibetanQA to measure cross-lingual transfer. Table <a href="#S4.T8" title="Table 8 ‣ Machine Reading Comprehension ‣ 4.3 Experimental Setup and Results ‣ 4 Evaluation Tasks and Results ‣ CUTE: A Multilingual Dataset for Enhancing Cross-Lingual Knowledge Transfer in Low-Resource Languages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">8</span></a> presents the results using Exact Match (EM) and F1 scores.</p>
</div>
<figure id="S4.T8" class="ltx_table">
<div id="S4.T8.2" class="ltx_inline-block ltx_align_center ltx_transformed_outer" style="width:345.0pt;height:110.9pt;vertical-align:-52.2pt;"><span class="ltx_transformed_inner" style="transform:translate(40.1pt,-12.9pt) scale(1.30257209064943,1.30257209064943) ;">
