</section>
<section id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h4 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Translation</h4>

<div id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="S4.SS3.SSS0.Px4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">For the translation task, we evaluate the models’ performance on Chinese-to-Tibetan (zh-bo) and Chinese-to-Uyghur (zh-ug) translation using the Flores-200 dataset. We employ few-shot prompting with 3 examples for each language pair. Table <a href="#S4.T9" title="Table 9 ‣ Translation ‣ 4.3 Experimental Setup and Results ‣ 4 Evaluation Tasks and Results ‣ CUTE: A Multilingual Dataset for Enhancing Cross-Lingual Knowledge Transfer in Low-Resource Languages" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">9</span></a> presents the results using BLEU, chrF, and TER (Translation Edit Rate) metrics.</p>
</div>
